# Guards that walk their posts and look about at each, as a body that waits
# (Kest's `resumes`) kept in a replicated component (D268).
program patrol.kest

component 7c2e9a14-3b58-4d61-9f0a-2e8d5b1c6a73 patrol.guard Guard

system patrol.watch simulation watch write patrol.guard

replicate patrol.guard

spawn 2 patrol.guard posts=3
